Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?plot=5Fgateways.jl:=20fix=20the=20CAA=20table's?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20day=20label=20("$(a)=E2=80=93$(b)")?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

"$a–$b" does not parse: Julia reads the en dash as part of the variable
name. Patch 025's CAA block is reached only for runs with Nares, Jones and
Barrow sections.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvkZczyeYtTrrNtPzaw
---
 nested/plot_gateways.jl | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/nested/plot_gateways.jl b/nested/plot_gateways.jl
index c3c2141..1817332 100644
--- a/nested/plot_gateways.jl
+++ b/nested/plot_gateways.jl
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
         push!(cells, @sprintf("%+6.2f/%+6.2f", sum(M, caa), sum(G, caa)))
         push!(cells, @sprintf("%+6.2f/%+6.2f", M("davis"), G("davis")))
-        @printf("%-10s %15s %15s %15s %15s %15s\n", "$a–$b", cells...)
+        @printf("%-10s %15s %15s %15s %15s %15s\n", "$(a)–$(b)", cells...)
     end
 end
